OL,3,GNEWSASpeed up regulation for 'Wild
OL,4,AWest' e-bike schemes, says mayor
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mayor of London says the government
OL,7,Fis taking too long introducing
OL,8,Fregulations for dockless e-bike
OL,9,Fschemes, with the rules not due to be
OL,10,Fin place until at least 2028.
OL,12,FE-bike operators have also accused
OL,13,FLondon of dragging its feet and said
OL,14,Fthe capital had no clear strategy.
OL,16,FThe plan is to regulate the schemes and
OL,17,Fstandardise the rules across London
OL,18,Fbecause different boroughs have
OL,19,Fdifferent operators and regulations.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
