OL,3,GNEWSASpeed up regulation for 'Wild
OL,4,AWest' e-bike schemes, says mayor
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government said it planned to
OL,7,Flaunch a consultation in the coming
OL,8,Fmonths before setting out new rules and
OL,9,Fregulations.
